INSTALL https://daugasauron.com/demos/javascript/Dollyfile-javascript 1a17695b2df4c6c8a2d0ccd32c6e4877ea57d853683d71945ed065ebd915052d
INSTALL https://daugasauron.com/demos/pi/Dollyfile-pi-coding-agent 1876b7998aef76facfc0fb44523f8630d965798e7d506c3a3ac1666f57157a62
REQUIRES TOOL cc
